      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every Labor Day since 1996, the community has celebrated the Sweet Tater Festival, a quirky event that now takes place at Smith Lake Park.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
